<translation id="4877141231724140862">I-Browther - Inethiwekhi Yokungena ngemvume - <ph name="PAGE_TITLE"/></translation>
<translation id="2190166659037789668">Buyekeza iphutha lokuchekha: <ph name="UPDATE_CHECK_ERROR"/>.</translation>
<translation id="6696114732806961952">Susa i-akhawunti kuBrave</translation>
<translation id="1084363153644366288">Hlala uphephile lapho usendleleni Ngokubhrawuza Okuphephe Ngokuthuthukisiwe kuBrave ye-iOS</translation>
<translation id="7949164640723239455">Isayithi eyingozi. I-Browther isuse izaziso.</translation>
<translation id="2236949375853147973">Umsebenzi Wami</translation>
<translation id="4536403809133456417">Ukuze uthole amakheli akho nokuningi kuwo wonke amadivayisi akho, ngena ngemvume kuBrave. Leli kheli lizolondolozwa kuBrave sync chain yakho ngemva kokungena ngemvume.</translation>
<translation id="5627930103267312171">Uma wabelana ngekhompyutha, abangani nomndeni bangadlulisa amehlo ngokuhlukile baphinde basethe i-Browther ngendlela abafuna ngayo nje.</translation>
<translation id="2283803047247799269">Sesha le thebhu Ngosesho Lomfanekiso</translation>
<translation id="1133671091758900032">{NUM_TABS,plural, =1{IBrave incoma ukumisa ithebhu enciphisa ijubane lebhrawuza yakho}one{IBrave incoma ukumisa amathebhu anciphisa ijubane lebhrawuza yakho}other{IBrave incoma ukumisa amathebhu anciphisa ijubane lebhrawuza yakho}}</translation>
<translation id="2307973900865360088">Kugcine Edokhini</translation>
<translation id="5161617112768367959">Kuhlola ama-URL anohlu lwamasayithi angaphephile agcinwe ku-Browther. Uma isayithi lizama ukuntshontsha iphasiwedi yakho, noma uma ulanda ifayela eliyingozi, i-Browther ingathumela nama-URL, kuhlanganise nokuthile okuqukethwe kulelo khasi, Ekuphequluleni Okuphephile.</translation>
<translation id="4123094831918713833">Lesi senzo sizokwenza lokhu:
          <ph name="LINE_BREAKS"/>
           • Setha kabusha amanye wamasethingi eBrave nezinqamuleli zeBrave
           <ph name="LINE_BREAK"/>
           • Khubaza izandiso
           <ph name="LINE_BREAK"/>
           • Sula amakhukhi nenye idatha yesikhashana yesayithi
            <ph name="LINE_BREAKS"/>
           Amabhukhimakhi, umlando, namaphasiwedi alondoloziwe ngeke aze athinteke.</translation>
<translation id="5456070119344236353">Ukuze uthumele inombolo kusukela lapha kufoni yakho ye-Android, ngena ngemvume ku-Browther kuwo womabili amadivayisi.</translation>
<translation id="2356070529366658676">Buza</translation>
<translation id="2359808026110333948">Qhubeka</translation>
