<translation id="5295781918312989856">Ukuze usebenzise lesi sandiso njenge-<ph name="USER_EMAIL_ADDRESS"/>, ngena ngemvume kuBrave.</translation>
<translation id="8418845734693287262">I-ChromeOS ayikwazanga ukuvumelanisa idatha yakho ngoba imininingwane yokungena ngemvume kwi-akhawunti yakho iphelelwe isikhathi.</translation>
<translation id="5288505984482120202">{NUM_DEVICES,plural, =0{Idivayisi e-1 ye-HID ibifinyelelwa yisandiso se-Browther esisodwa noma eziningi}=1{Idivayisi e-1 ye-HID ifinyelelwa yisandiso se-Browther esisodwa noma eziningi}one{Amadivayisi angu-# e-HID abefinyelelwa yisandiso se-Browther esisodwa noma eziningi}other{Amadivayisi angu-# e-HID abefinyelelwa yisandiso se-Browther esisodwa noma eziningi}}</translation>
<translation id="434258293817844111">I-Browther idinga izimvume zekhamera nemakrofoni kule sayithi</translation>
<translation id="2403703063067034158">Iphutha lokuqala: esinye isenzakalo sokusetha siyaqalisa okwamanje, sicela uzame futhi ngokuhamba kwesikhathi.</translation>
<translation id="5458993228789433099">Vula amalinki kuBrave kunoma iyiphi i-app futhi ugcine ibhrawuza ifinyeleleka ku-taskbar yakho</translation>
<translation id="1677640217693742525"><ph name="BEGIN_LINK"/>Ngamathuluzi avela ku-Browther<ph name="END_LINK"/>, ungabhrawuza ngokuphepha bese uhlala ulawula</translation>
<translation id="2451727308784734061">Sebenzisa isinqamuleli sakho ukuze ufike ngokushesha Kusiphathi Sephasiwedi. Ungahambisa isinqamuleli sakho esikrinini sasekhaya sekhompyutha yakho noma isiqalisi se-app.</translation>
