<translation id="7892218991241200190">I-Browther izama ukufaka amaphasiwedi akhona esikhundleni. Thayipha iphasiwedi yakho ye-Windows ukuze uvumele lokhu.</translation>
<translation id="8976443723926188033">I-Browther idinga ukufinyelela kusitoreji ukuze ilande amafayela</translation>
