<translation id="8705561858232289221">Ukuze uthole amaphasiwedi akho kanye nokwengeziwe kuwo wonke amadivayisi akho, ngena ngemvume kuBrave</translation>
<translation id="437162022240011372">Qhubeka usebenzisa i-Browther</translation>
<translation id="259935314519650377">Yehlulekile ukufaka enqolobaneni isifaki esidawunilodiwe. Iphutha: <ph name="UNPACK_CACHING_ERROR_CODE"/>.</translation>
<translation id="2620436844016719705">Isistimu</translation>
<translation id="2907676829052962091">Inhlangano yakho ingabona futhi ilawule idatha yopheqululo, efana namabhukhimakhi akho, umlando, namaphasiwedi. Ayikwazi ukubona idatha yokubhrawuza kwamanye amaphrofayela eBrave</translation>
<translation id="1289116577679005654">Qinisekisa ukuthi nguwe ukuze usebenzise futhi ulondoloze idatha yeBrave ku-akhawunti yakho, <ph name="ACCOUNT_EMAIL"/></translation>
<translation id="8762228142105311329">{COUNT,plural, =0{Ukuvikelwa Okuthuthukile kudinga ukuthi uqalise kabusha iBrave ukuze usebenzise isibuyekezo}=1{Ukuvikelwa Okuthuthukile kudinga ukuthi uqalise kabusha iBrave ukuze usebenzise isibuyekezo. Iwindi lakho le-Incognito ngeke liphinde livuleke.}one{Ukuvikelwa Okuthuthukile kudinga ukuthi uqalise kabusha iBrave ukuze usebenzise isibuyekezo. Amawindi akho angu-# e-Incognito ngeke aze aphinde avuleke.}other{Ukuvikelwa Okuthuthukile kudinga ukuthi uqalise kabusha iBrave ukuze usebenzise isibuyekezo. Amawindi akho angu-# e-Incognito ngeke aze aphinde avuleke.}}</translation>
<translation id="7192278346779151664">Iphutha le sistimu yokusebenza livele ngesikhathi sokufaka. Sicela uphinde ulande i-Browther.</translation>
<translation id="7724398260867885339">Uma wabelana ngedivayisi, abangane nomndeni bangaphequlula ngokuhlukile baphinde basethe i-Browther ngendlela abafuna ngayo</translation>
<translation id="1679595317134614424">Ithebhu le-Browther</translation>
<translation id="7189168846924379421">Ngokuvikela okungeziwe, i-Browther izobethela idatha yakho.</translation>
<translation id="4052643592793184278">Ukuze ususe i-Browther sync chain yakho ku-Browther, phuma ngemvume</translation>
<translation id="7694616023994438906">Ukuze uthole amaphasiwedi wakho, amabhukhimakhi, nokuningi kuwo wonke amadivayisi akho, ngena ngemvume kuBrave</translation>
<translation id="2738871930057338499">Ayikwazi ukuxhuma ku-inthanethi I-HTTP 403 Yenqatshelwe. Sicela uchekhe ukulungiselelwa kommeleli wakho.</translation>
<translation id="2753623023919742414">Chofoza ukuze useshe</translation>
<translation id="9078193405195503710">Setha iBrave njengesibuki sakho esizenzakalelayo se-PDF</translation>
<translation id="2456995288904753506">IBrave ingagcwalisa ngokuzenzekela izinkambu ezinzima ukuthi ukuzigcwalisela okujwayelekile kungase kuziphuthe</translation>
<translation id="3271730304285122987">Lesi sandiso sinohlelo olungayilungele ikhompyutha futhi asiphephile. Sisuse ku-Browther ukuze singasakwazi ukubona nokushintsha idatha yakho kumasayithi owavakashelayo, okufaka phakathi ulwazi lwakho lomuntu siqu.</translation>
