<translation id="2945997411976714835">Iphutha lokufaka: Inqubo yesifaki yehlulekile ukuqala.</translation>
<translation id="3188308520233701133">Ngena ngemvume ngokushesha kumasayithi usebenzisa amaphasiwedi alondoloziwe weBrave ku-iOS</translation>
<translation id="8145318807880784886">Engeza iphrofayela entsha yeBrave ukuze uhlukanise amabhukhimakhi, amaphasiwedi, namasethingi.</translation>
