<translation id="300557164611864786">Uma isayithi lizama ukuntshontsha iphasiwedi yakho, noma uma ulanda ifayela eliyingozi, i-Browther ingathumela nama-URL, kuhlanganise nokuthile okuqukethwe kulelo khasi, Ekuphequluleni Okuphephile</translation>
<translation id="2447145782593796785">Ukuze uhlale uphephile ku-inthanethi ngokukhethwayo komzali wakho, ngena ngemvume kuBrave</translation>
<translation id="3003694935412297923">Yonke imisebenzi</translation>
<translation id="7554113777150891030">{count,plural, =1{IBrave idinga ukuqinisekisa ukuthi uwena ngaphambi kokuthi idatha ethile ilondolozwe kuBrave sync chain yakho futhi isetshenziswe kuwo wonke amadivayisi akho. Uma uphuma ngemvume manje, le datha (into e-1) izosulwa.}one{IBrave idinga ukuqinisekisa ukuthi uwena ngaphambi kokuthi idatha ethile ilondolozwe kuBrave sync chain yakho futhi isetshenziswe kuwo wonke amadivayisi akho. Uma uphuma ngemvume manje, le datha (izinto ezingu-{count}) izosulwa.}other{IBrave idinga ukuqinisekisa ukuthi uwena ngaphambi kokuthi idatha ethile ilondolozwe kuBrave sync chain yakho futhi isetshenziswe kuwo wonke amadivayisi akho. Uma uphuma ngemvume manje, le datha (izinto ezingu-{count}) izosulwa.}}</translation>
