<translation id="3525563861100145512">{NUM_DEVICES,plural, =0{Idivayisi e-1 ye-USB ibifinyelelwa yisandiso se-Browther esisodwa noma eziningi}=1{Idivayisi e-1 ye-USB ifinyelelwa yisandiso se-Browther esisodwa noma eziningi}one{Amadivayisi angu-# e-USB abefinyelelwa yisandiso se-Browther esisodwa noma eziningi}other{Amadivayisi angu-# e-USB abefinyelelwa yisandiso se-Browther esisodwa noma eziningi}}</translation>
<translation id="2065456480740480340">Umlando weBrave</translation>
<translation id="5011660649081947055">Isifaki sihlulekile ukungaminyanisi ingobo yomlando. Sicela ulande i-Browther futhi.</translation>
<translation id="310459126943037700">Yehlulekile ukuqeda imisebenzi.</translation>
<translation id="3104828284009500087">Sesha noma yini ekhasini</translation>
<translation id="4917564010081457061">Gcina amaphasiwedi akho, amabhukhimakhi, nomlando kuvunyelaniswe ngokuphelele kuwo wonke amadivayisi. Finyelela kalula izakhi ozaziyo nozithandayo ngokubuyekeza ibhrawuza yakho evuleka ngokuzenzakalelayo ibe yiBrave.</translation>
<translation id="1041472930719344928">I-Browther isebenzisa imakrofoni yakho.</translation>
<translation id="3130333203120345554">Usesho olusha</translation>
<translation id="3137969841538672700">Hudulela oseshweni</translation>
<translation id="5312717254055363883">Le thebhu isebenzisa izinsiza ezengeziwe. Ukuze uthuthukise ukusebenza kwakho, vumela iBrave ikwenze kungasebenzi.</translation>
<translation id="373523409348786203">Ukuze wabelane ngesikrini sakho, vumela ukurekhodwa kwesikrini kweBrave Kumasethingi Ohlelo</translation>
