<translation id="5150830326120505481">Ukuze ususe i-Browther sync chain yakho ku-Browther, phuma ngemvume ku-Browther ekhasini Lamasethingi</translation>
<translation id="7113660200899017820">Emva kwesikhathi, iBrave ingakucela ukuthi usebenzise ulwazi olulondoloziwe ukuze uzigcwalisele amafomu</translation>
<translation id="4475011322243623412">I-Browther ayikwazi ukufunda nokubhala umkhombandlela wayo wedatha:

<ph name="USER_DATA_DIRECTORY"/></translation>
<translation id="3286538390144397061">Qala kabusha manje</translation>
<translation id="3536063527222598206">Okhiye be-Browther API abekho. Okunye ukusebenza kwe-Browther kuzokhutshazwa.</translation>
<translation id="1011450868746766298">Qhubeka usebenzise izinhlelo zokusebenza ezingemuva uma i-Browther ivaliwe</translation>
<translation id="179611081153855734">I-Browther izokuxwayisa ngaphambi kokulayisha noma iyiphi isayithi isebenzisa uxhumo olungavikelekile</translation>
<translation id="8965591964936552871">Uzophuma ngemvume emasayithini amaningi uma uvala wonke amawindi e-Browther, ngaphandle kwe-Browther sync chain yakho uma ungene ngemvume ku-Browther. Ukuvumela amasayithi akukhumbule, <ph name="SETTINGS_LINK"/>.</translation>
<translation id="6626350400537358074">Injini yakho yokusesha ezenzakalelayo ishintshwe ngaphandle kweBrave. Ukuze ikuvikele, iBrave iyisethe kabusha.</translation>
<translation id="1170501833661894915">Ngena ngemvume kuBrave ukuze uthole amaphasiwedi, amabhukhimakhi nokuningi kuwo wonke amadivayisi akho</translation>
<translation id="3352986031709923790">ikhona elingaphezulu ngakwesokudla lendawo yokusesha: ngakwesokudla okungu-<ph name="RIGHT"/>%, phezulu okungu-<ph name="TOP"/>%</translation>
<translation id="120745000989996104">Idatha ye-Browther ku-akhawunti yakho</translation>
<translation id="3369405342922656244">Sesha leli khasi ngesakhi esithi Ukusesha Ngezithombe</translation>
<translation id="7173761126541905083">Sebenzisa amaphasiwedi akho ngeBrave efonini yakho</translation>
<translation id="2645435784669275700">I-ChromeOS</translation>
<translation id="5266583242423616945">Shintshela kwiphrofayela le-Browther elikhona kakade?</translation>
<translation id="3412460710772753638">Kokuthi Isiphathi Sephasiwedi kule divayisi</translation>
<translation id="4282363917570905631">Nweba Ukubhrawuza Okuphephe Ngokuthuthukisiwe ngeBrave efonini yakho</translation>
<translation id="986094398735583155">Yenza iBrave ibe ngeyakho...</translation>
<translation id="3266047225484320321">I-Browther izokwazisa uma ungena ngemvume ngephasiwedi eyonakalisiwe</translation>
<translation id="3508047337876211050">Lokhu kuzobuyekeza izinto ezingu-<ph name="ITEMS_COUNT"/> kusuka kule divayisi. Ukuze ubuyise idatha yakho, ngena ngemvume ku-<ph name="USER_EMAIL"/> njengo.</translation>
<translation id="7772248897860792723">I-<ph name="SHORTCUT"/> ingashintsha phakathi kwamaphrofayela we-Browther</translation>
<translation id="7225005776233199285">Sicela uvale wonke amawindi we-Browther uphinde uzame futhi.</translation>
<translation id="5465054931427475969">Ukuze wabelane ngewindi lakho, vumela ukurekhodwa kwesikrini kweBrave Kumasethingi Ohlelo.</translation>
<translation id="6905469223518185641">U-<ph name="EXISTING_USER"/> usevele ungene ngemvume.  Ukuze ugcine ukubhrawuza kwakho kuhlukile, ngena ngemvume ku-Browther kuphrofayela yakho njengo-<ph name="USER_EMAIL_ADDRESS"/></translation>
<translation id="8133590217245064579">Ukuze wabelane ngesikrini sakho, vumela ukurekhodwa kwesikrini kweBrave Kumasethingi Ohlelo.</translation>
<translation id="3597003331831379823">Ihlulekile ukuqalisa isethaphu ngamalungelo aphakeme. <ph name="METAINSTALLER_ERROR"/></translation>
<translation id="611080704131468868">Ngena ngemvume kuBrave</translation>
<translation id="2492221622209669678">Idatha yokuphequlula yalo muntu izosuswa kusukela kule divayisi. Ukuze uphinde uthole idatha, ngena ngemvume ku-Browther njengo-<ph name="USER_EMAIL"/>.</translation>
<translation id="4555500675737067970">{COUNT,plural, =0{Isibuyekezo esisha se-Browther siyatholakala futhi sizosetshenziswa maduze ngemuva kokuthi uqalise kabusha.}=1{Isibuyekezo esisha se-Browther siyatholakala futhi sizosetshenziswa maduze ngemuva kokuthi uqalise kabusha. Iwindi lakho le-Incognito ngeke liphinde livuleke.}one{Isibuyekezo esisha se-Browther siyatholakala futhi sizosetshenziswa maduze ngemuva kokuthi uqalise kabusha. Amawindi akho angu-# e-Incognito ngeke aze aphinde avuleke.}other{Isibuyekezo esisha se-Browther siyatholakala futhi sizosetshenziswa maduze ngemuva kokuthi uqalise kabusha. Amawindi akho angu-# e-Incognito ngeke aze aphinde avuleke.}}</translation>
<translation id="6793778233257855801">Ukuze uthumele inombolo kusukela ku-<ph name="ORIGIN"/> kufoni yakho ye-Android, ngena ngemvume ku-Browther kuwo womabili amadivayisi.</translation>
<translation id="3667616615096815454">Ayikwazi ukufaka, uhlelo lokusebenza alwaziwa kuseva.</translation>
<translation id="5585500151754164442">Sebenzisa <ph name="BEGIN_LINK"/>umushwana wokungena <ph name="END_LINK"/>ukuze ubhale ngokubethela idatha yeBrave kuBrave sync chain yakho. Izindlela zokukhokha namakheli kusuka kuGoogle Pay ngeke kubethelwe. Umlando wokubhrawuza ovela kuBrave ngeke uvumelanise.</translation>
<translation id="404323216042159951">I-Browther ayikwazi ukuhlola iphasiwedi yakho. Zama ukuhlola ukuxhumeka kwakho ku-inthanethi.</translation>
<translation id="6181263681651521876">{COUNT,plural, =0{Umlawuli wakho ucela ukuthi uqalise kabusha i-Browther ukuze kusetshenziswe lesi sibuyekezo}=1{Umlawuli wakho ucela ukuthi uqalise kabusha i-Browther ukuze kusetshenziswe lesi sibuyekezo. Iwindi lakho le-Incognito ngeke liphinde livuleke.}one{Umlawuli wakho ucela ukuthi uqalise kabusha i-Browther ukuze kusetshenziswe lesi sibuyekezo. Amawindi akho angu-# e-Incognito ngeke aze aphinde avuleke.}other{Umlawuli wakho ucela ukuthi uqalise kabusha i-Browther ukuze kusetshenziswe lesi sibuyekezo. Amawindi akho angu-# e-Incognito ngeke aze aphinde avuleke.}}</translation>
<translation id="5004936474632127765">Vula isixhumanisi ku&amp;thebhu elisha le-Browther</translation>
<translation id="6236643159256182256">Linka i-Browther namanye amasevisi e-Browther ngokwenza ngokomuntu ngamunye nangezinye izinjongo</translation>
<translation id="3729187154190517324">Julisa usesho lwakho ngokufaka amathebhu amaningi, amafayela, namathuluzi usebenzisa inkinobho ethi "Faka ithebhu nokuningi".</translation>
<translation id="1400697664933775238">Phatha Amaphrofayela e-Browther</translation>
<translation id="2461315395128103158">Funda ukuthi kungani i-Browther ivimbela ukudawuniloda okuthile</translation>
<translation id="8058420662026104226">I-Browther izokwazisa uma kukhona okudinga isibuyekezo sakho</translation>
<translation id="3177448557921912221">Amaphrofayela eBrave akusiza uhlukanise izingxenye ezihlukene zokuphila kwakho. Engeza iphrofayela entsha manje.</translation>
<translation id="1541177876035612043">I-Browther ilayisha kusengaphambili amakhasi okungenzeka uwavakashele, ukuze alayishe ngokushesha lapho uwavakashela</translation>
<translation id="3810973564298564668">Phatha</translation>
<translation id="1117103475254549453">Ukuze usebenzise amaphasiwedi akho agciniwe, landela ikhodi ye-QR, dawuniloda iBrave ye-iOS bese ungena ngemvume kuBrave sync chain yakho</translation>
<translation id="8880695882192156860">Ithiphu yeBrave: Ukubhrawuza Okuphephe Ngokuthuthukisiwe</translation>
<translation id="3846683726093018685">**Fingqa:** Ngomusho owodwa onamagama angaphansi kwa-30, chaza abantu ebhekiswe kubo nenjongo eyinhloko yekhontenti yakho eku-screenshot.

          **Phakamisa Imibuzo:** Sungula uhlu lwamachashazi olunemibuzo emi-3 ukuya kwemi-5 eshukumisa ingqondo engase ibuzwe umsebenzisi ukuze asiqonde kahle i-screenshot. Le mibuzo kufanele ihlanganise okungenani owodwa okhuluma ngokuqondile ngento ebukwayo, indlela eklanywe ngayo, noma indawo ekuyo.</translation>
<translation id="8293474885560144454"><ph name="PAGE_TITLE"/> - Browther</translation>
<translation id="3885770153807205175">Okokukhetha ulimi</translation>
<translation id="4861846616763552424">Yenza ngokwezifiso uphinde ulawule i-Browther. Okuthile kudinga ukuthi ukunake - chofoza ngemininingwane.</translation>
<translation id="6126366281251241386">Chofoza igama lakho ukuze uvule i-Browther uphinde uqale ukudlulisa amehlo.</translation>
<translation id="3892148308691398805">Kopisha umbhalo</translation>
<translation id="3760801273210219822">U-<ph name="EXISTING_USER"/> usengene ngemvume kakade kule phrofayela ye-Browther. Ukuze uqhubeke nokuphequlula ngokwehlukile, i-Browther ingakwazi ukukudalela iphrofayela yakho.</translation>
<translation id="3593119910409528681">Lesi sandiso sephula inqubomgomo Yesitolo sewebu se-Browther, futhi kungenzeka singabi esiphephile. Sisuse ku-Browther ukuze singasakwazi ukubona nokushintsha idatha yakho kumasayithi owavakashelayo, okufaka phakathi ulwazi lwakho lomuntu siqu.</translation>
<translation id="3821553157234855663">Qamba ngokwabahlinzekelwayo iBrave Yakho</translation>
<translation id="3941890832296813527">Iphutha lokufaka: Igama lefayela lesifaki alivumelekile noma alisekelwe.</translation>
<translation id="6482299900191767005">I-Browther izama ukukopisha amaphasiwedi. Thayipha iphasiwedi yakho ye-Windows ukuze uvumele lokhu.</translation>
<translation id="5853011008278898603">Amaphasiwedi akho, izindlela zokukhokha, namakheli owalondoloze kuBrave sync chain yakho azosuswa kule divayisi. Ukuze uphinde uzisebenzise kuBrave, ngena ngemvume futhi.</translation>
<translation id="395904275706073188">Amakhasi avikelwe awakwazi ukufundwa. Zama ikhasi elehlukile.</translation>
<translation id="1832973663231751701">Funda ukuthi i-Browther ikugcina kanjani uphephile</translation>
<translation id="4531502594774670767">Uma uthayipha kubha yekheli noma ebhokisini lokusesha, iBrave ithumela okuthayiphayo kusesho lwenhlangano yakho, i-AI, nakumathuluzi omenzeli ukuthola iziphakamiso.</translation>
<translation id="300013383485253006">Mayelana ne-&amp;Browther Yokuhlola</translation>
<translation id="1152920704813762236">Mayelana ne-ChromeOS</translation>
<translation id="8126752030994997015">Lapho uvakashela isayithi, iBrave ithumela ingxenye eyi-obfuscation ye-URL kokuthi <ph name="BEGIN_LINK"/>Ukubhrawuza ngokuphephile kweBrave<ph name="END_LINK"/> isebenzisa iseva yangasese efihla ikheli lakho lasesizindeni se-inthanethi. Uma isayithi ingakusekeli okuthile okusolisayo, kuzothunyelwa wonke ama-URL kanye nekhontenti encane yekhasi.</translation>
<translation id="3703994572283698466">I-ChromeOS yenziwe ukuthi isebenze ngesofthiwe yomthombo ovulekile owengeziwe<ph name="BEGIN_LINK_CROS_OSS"/>isofthiwe yomthombo ovulekile<ph name="END_LINK_CROS_OSS"/>, njengoba kunjalo ngendawo yokuthuthukiswa kwe-<ph name="BEGIN_LINK_LINUX_OSS"/>Linux<ph name="END_LINK_LINUX_OSS"/>.</translation>
<translation id="4022972681110646219">Isikrini sokuhumusha</translation>
<translation id="4023601594785368013">Ulimi loqobo: <ph name="LANGUAGE"/></translation>
<translation id="6450460108719059465">Vula amalinki kuBrave kunoma iyiphi i-app. Futhi ukuze ifinyeleleke kalula, iphinwa ku-taskbar yakho.</translation>
<translation id="3437506136408403836">Siza i-Browther ibengcono ngokubika <ph name="BEGIN_LINK"/>izilungiselelo zamanje<ph name="END_LINK"/></translation>
