<translation id="5245976396374147971">Isexwayiso: I-Browther ayikwazi ukuvimbela izandiso kusuka ekurekhodeni umlando wakho wokudlulisa amehlo. Ukuze ukhubaze lesi sandiso kumodi ye-incognito, yekisa ukukhetha le nketho.</translation>
<translation id="7690070364551268156">Uma futhi wabelana ngemibiko yokusetshenziswa kwe-Browther, leyo mibiko ihlanganisa nama-URL owavakashelayo</translation>
<translation id="5020487088453637212">Iphrofayela ibukeka isetshenziswa enye inqubo ye-Browther (<ph name="PROCESS_ID"/>) kwenye ikhompyutha (<ph name="HOST_NAME"/>). I-Browther ikhiye iphrofayela ukuze ingamosheki. Uma uqinisekile ukuthi azikho ezinye izinqubo ezisebenzisa le phrofayela, ungavula iphrofayela uphinde uqalise i-Browther.</translation>
<translation id="4680828127924988555">Khansela Ukufaka</translation>
<translation id="8134827615154347946">Enye idatha yakho yeBrave ayikalondolozwa kuBrave sync chain. Zama ukulinda imizuzu embalwa ngaphambi kokuphuma ngemvume. Uma uphuma ngemvume manje, le datha izosulwa.</translation>
<translation id="3508712423420506333">Ngenkathi ungene ngemvume, ungasebenzisa amaphasiwedi akho nokuningi ukusuka kuBrave sync chain yakho kuBrave. I-<ph name="SHORTCUT"/> ingashintsha amasethingi wakho wamasevisi eBrave.</translation>
<translation id="2388739442635757494">Umuntu othile ungene ngemvume ngaphambilini ku-Browther kule khompuyutha njengo-<ph name="ACCOUNT_EMAIL_LAST"/>. Sicela udale umsebenzisi omusha we-Browther ukuze ugcine ulwazi lwakho luhlukile.</translation>
<translation id="4724676981607797757">Ukufaka kuhlulekile ngenxa yephutha lephrothokholi engasekelwe.</translation>
