<translation id="5064473048847774331">Awukavakashi kamuva nje. IBrave isuse i-<ph name="PERMISSION_1"/>, i-<ph name="PERMISSION_2"/>, nokunye okungu-<ph name="COUNT"/> okwengeziwe</translation>
<translation id="5941343075741207533">I-Browther ayikwazi ukuhlola iphasiwedi yakho. Zama futhi ngemva kwamahora angu-24 noma <ph name="BEGIN_LINK"/>hlola amaphasiwedi ku-akhawunti yakho ye-Browther<ph name="END_LINK"/>.</translation>
<translation id="3854190830798038395">Lokhu kusebenzisa isihloli sokupeleta esifanayo naleso esisetshenziswe kusesho lwe-Browther. Umbhalo owuthayiphayo kusiphequluli uthunyelwa ku-Browther. Ungahlala ushintsha le mpatho kuzilungiselelo.</translation>
