<translation id="6120233890602288442">Ngamaphrofayela weBrave ungahlukanisa zonke izinto zakho zeBrave. Sungula amaphrofayela wabangane nomndeni, noma uhlukanise phakathi komsebenzi nobumnandi.</translation>
