<translation id="2076355018722231995">Uma ubhrawuza ngemodi ye-Incognito, i-Browther izokuxwayisa ngaphambi kokulayisha isayithi isebenzisa uxhumo olungavikelekile.</translation>
<translation id="8472078903122489041">Isevisi Yangaphakathi Yesibuyekezi SeBrave</translation>
<translation id="5346389065299425353">Julisa usesho lwakho ngokufaka amathebhu amaningi, amafayela, namathuluzi</translation>
<translation id="3904682305383981098">I-Browther ithole izincomo ezithile zokuphepha zokubuyekeza kwakho</translation>
<translation id="509616246140011182">Amanye Amaphrofayela e-Browther</translation>
<translation id="8214429210535362385">Ungena ngemvume nge-akhawunti ephethwe futhi unikeza umlawuli wayo ukulawula okungaphezulu kwephrofayela yakho ye-Browther. Idatha yakho ye-Browther, efana nezinhlelo zakho zokusebenza, amabhukhimakhi, umlando, amaphasiwedi, nezinye izilungiselelo zizoboshezelwa unaphakade ku-<ph name="USER_NAME"/>. Uzokwazi ukususa le datha nge-Ideshibhodi yama-Akhawunti we-Browther, kodwa ngeke uze ukwazi ukuhlobanisa le datha nenye i-akhawunti. <ph name="LEARN_MORE"/></translation>
