<translation id="4215338057953170891">Amaphrofayela eBrave akuvumela ukuba uhlukanise ukubhrawuza kwakho siqu nomsebenzi. Engeza iphrofayela entsha manje.</translation>
<translation id="5366435608642317052">IBrave ikhulula inkumbulo kumathebhu angasebenzi. Lokhu kunikeza amathebhu asebenzayo namanye ama-app izinsiza zekhompyutha ezengeziwe futhi kugcina iBrave ishesha. Amathebhu akho angasebenzi aphinde asebenze ngokuzenzekela uma ubuyela kuwo. <ph name="BEGIN_LINK"/>Funda kabanzi mayelana Nesilondolozi Senkumbulo<ph name="END_LINK"/></translation>
<translation id="4941518395341035738">Uma ukhohlwa umushwana wakho wokungena noma ufuna ukushintsha le sethingi, <ph name="SETTINGS_LINK"/> idatha yeBrave ku-akhawunti yakho</translation>
<translation id="7763291835437810978">Yenza ngokwezifiso uphinde ulawule i-Browther. Setha i-Browther njengokwakho okuzenzakalelayo.</translation>
