<translation id="1827132270895283425">Isheshisa amasayithi ngenjini yeBrave V8 kodwa yenza iBrave imelane kancane nokuhlaselwa. Le sethingi livaliwe.</translation>
<translation id="1553025851718680114">Ukuze usebenzise futhi ulondoloze idatha yeBrave kuBrave sync chain yakho, buyekeza iBrave</translation>
<translation id="5824893331272123205">Ayikwazanga ukulayisha leli phaneli, zama futhi</translation>
