<translation id="1527644038571473502">Ukuze wabelane ngomsindo wohlelo, vula Amasethingi Ohlelo bese uvumela okuthi 'Ukurekhodwa Komsindo Wohlelo Kuphela' kuBrave. Ngemva kwalokho kuzodingeka uqale kabusha iBrave.</translation>
<translation id="1427913074981060872">Isilinganiso sesikhangiso sivumela amasayithi owavakashelayo ukuba acele ulwazi ku-Browther olusiza isayithi ukukala ukusebenza kwezikhangiso zawo. Isilinganiso sesikhangiso sikhawulela ukulandelela indawo yonke ngokudlulisa ulwazi oluncane ngangokunokwenzeka phakathi kwamasayithi.</translation>
